<title>USA: GTE offers long-distance service in Arizona.</title>
<headline>GTE offers long-distance service in Arizona.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>GTE Corp said Monday it began offering long-distance telephone services to customers in Arizona.</p>
<p>The service is being offered under the name GTE Easy Savings Plan, which is now available in 22 states.</p>
</text>
